### PINN demo: KdV  u_t + u u_x + u_3x = 0  (coords: x=var1, t=var2)
### exact soliton u = 3 sech^2(0.5(x-t)), domain x in [-8,8], t in [0,2]
### set 1 = initial/boundary data (MATH), set 2 = collocation (PINN residual)
Output_deriv 1 /
Init_w       LeCun_unif
Rand_seed    20260804 / fixed seed (reproducibility)
Restart      0 /
Nlayer       4 / L
2  / ndim(1): (x,t)
16 /
16 /
1  / ndim(L)
###
Loss_term  DATA         100  data.dat           1.d0 /
Loss_term  COLLOCATION     200  colloc.dat         0.2d0 /
###
Residual 3 / term lines follow: LIN c a1..aD0 | UUX c a1..aD0 | DXLAP c j
LIN   1.d0  3 0 /  u_3x  (alpha over (x,t): "3 0")
UUX   1.d0  1 0 /  u u_x
LIN   1.d0  0 1 /  u_t
Exact_solution 1 / colloc.dat carries u_exact (error reporting only)
Hod_check 1 /
###
Num_validation 30 /
Validation_cyc 200 /
P_max          100000 /
###
Epoch      20000 /
Activation TANH /
Conv       1.d-12 /
Num_batch  20 /
Checkpoint_cyc         2000 /
GD_method  Adam
GD_param   0.003d0 0.9d0 0.999d0 1.d-8 0.d0 /
